00:52:11.394 --> 00:52:15.132
and you know, some
little nuts in 'em.

00:52:15.132 --> 00:52:16.399
It's delicious.

00:52:16.399 --> 00:52:17.934
And whatever you like,
I can cook all of it.

00:52:17.934 --> 00:52:18.869
I love it.

00:52:18.869 --> 00:52:19.669
Shish kabob, what do you like?

00:52:19.669 --> 00:52:21.171
What's your pleasure?

00:52:21.171 --> 00:52:23.106
You're from California.

00:52:25.175 --> 00:52:26.710
