and chicken on a shish kabob

00:52:29.546 --> 00:52:32.883
with peppers and onions and
tomatoes, all that stuff.

00:52:32.883 --> 00:52:34.151
That'd be good.

00:52:34.151 --> 00:52:35.819
- You see how I just
invited myself over

00:52:35.819 --> 00:52:37.154
and you laid out
the menu for me.

00:52:37.154 --> 00:52:38.155
Pretty good, huh?

00:52:38.155 --> 00:52:39.689
