00:52:39.689 --> 00:52:41.525
There's a mother
in me, you know?

00:52:42.792 --> 00:52:43.727
I beg my kids.

00:52:43.727 --> 00:52:44.528
I'd say, "Come home, guys.

00:52:44.528 --> 00:52:45.729
